<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips Q3 normal net 123 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>Philips Q3 normal net 123 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third qtr 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from normal ops		123  vs    539</p>
<p>    Net/shr from normal ops (guilders)   0.36  vs   1.57</p>
<p>    Net profit				    123  vs    539 profit</p>
<p>    Total net/shr (guilders)		 0.36  vs   1.57</p>
<p>    Net sales (billions)		    15.99  vs  15.32</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast net profit from normal operations of 240-360 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Income from operations (billions)     281  vs    922</p>
<p>    Financial income and expenses	   218  vs    232 charge</p>
<p>    Income before taxes			  63  vs    690</p>
<p>    Income taxes				   13  vs    138</p>
<p>Equity in income of unconsolidated</p>
<p>				companies	    86  vs     52</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
